  {
    "id": "20261119-224056",
    "rubric": "Donalik va kichik buyurtmalar",
    "title": "Taobao: Qo‘lqop o‘lchamini qanday tanlash kerak?",
    "text": "🧤 <b>TAOBAO’DA QO‘LQOP O‘LCHAMINI QANDAY TANLASH KERAK?</b>\n\nSovuq kunlar uchun qo‘lqop olayotganda faqat odatdagi o‘lchamingizga tayanmang. Avval qo‘lingizni o‘lchab ko‘ring.\n\n<b>Immensus Post maslahati:</b>\n\n↕️ 🖐️ ↔️\n↕️ Qo‘l uzunligi\n↔️ Kaft atrofi\n\n1️⃣ O‘rta barmoq uchidan bilakkacha o‘lchang.\n2️⃣ Kaftingizning eng keng joyi atrofini o‘lchang.\n3️⃣ Ikkala natijani sotuvchining o‘lcham jadvali bilan solishtiring.\n4️⃣ Mos o‘lchamni tanlab, savatchaga qo‘shing.\n\nMasalan, o‘zingizga yoki yaqinlaringizga qo‘lqop tanlasangiz, ikkala o‘lchovni ham jadvalda tekshiring.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.rei.com/rei/gearshop/sizefinder/mthardwear.html\">Manba</a> · <a href=\"https://zippy.rei.com/learn/expert-advice/snow-gloves-and-mittens--how-to-choose.html\">Manba</a>\n\n📌 Foydali bo'lsa, postni saqlab qo'ying va yaqinlaringizga ulashing. 🔔 Xitoy platformalari bo'yicha sodda qo'llanmalar — @immensuspost\n\n#ImmensusPost #XitoydanBuyurtma #FoydaliMaslahat",
    "kind": "photo",
    "file_id": "AgACAgUAAxkDAAIBe2r_e4I_34EE2zKiSSKuWa8_7OXGAALkEWsbPfUBVGkawUFbtEiCAQADAgADeQADPQQ",
    "media_path": "/home/runner/work/immensus-post/immensus-post/.work/20261119-224056/image.png",
    "topic": {
      "title": "Taobao: Qo‘lqop o‘lchamini qanday tanlash kerak?",
      "angle": "Qo‘l uzunligi va kaft atrofini o‘lchab, sotuvchining o‘lcham jadvali bilan solishtiring. O‘lchash joylarini qo‘l rasmi bilan ko‘rsating.",
      "why_now": "Sovuq mavsumda qo‘lqop xaridi dolzarb.",
      "research": "Quyidagi mavzular **19-noyabr 2026** holatida mavsumiy yoki kundalik ehtiyoj uchun dolzarb. Platforma nomlari mavzuning qo‘llanish joyini bildiradi; manbalar esa umumiy xarid maslahatlarini tasdiqlaydi, platformadagi tugma yoki xizmat qoidalarini emas.\n\n1. **Taobao: Qo‘lqop o‘lchamini qanday tanlash kerak?**  \n   **Burchak:** Qo‘l uzunligi va kaft atrofini o‘lchab, sotuvchining jadvali bilan solishtirish. Format: qo‘l rasmi bilan kichik infografika.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovuq mavsum uchun qo‘lqop xaridi dolzarb. ([rei.com](https://www.rei.com/rei/gearshop/sizefinder/mthardwear.html?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10.\n\n2. **Tmall: Uzuk sovg‘a qilganda o‘lchamni qanday bilish mumkin?**  \n   **Burchak:** Mos keladigan eski uzukning ichki enini o‘lchab, yangi uzukning jadvali bilan solishtirish. Format: sodda illyustratsiya.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovg‘a tanlash mavsumida o‘lchamdagi xatoni kamaytirishga yordam beradi. ([tiffany.com](https://www.tiffany.com/client-services/size-guide.html?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10.\n\n3. **Pinduoduo: Qalin paypoq poyabzalga mos keladimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Paypoq o‘lchami va qalinligini tekshirish, uni kiyiladigan poyabzalning kengligi bilan solishtirish. Format: qisqa tekshiruv ro‘yxati.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Sovuq kunlarda qalin paypoq tanlash ehtiyoji ortadi. ([rei.com](https://www.rei.com/learn/expert-advice/socks.html?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10.\n\n4. **Taobao: Rezinali choyshab matrasga sig‘adimi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Matrasning eni, bo‘yi va qalinligini o‘lchab, choyshab tavsifidagi o‘lchamlar bilan solishtirish. Format: matras rasmi ustida uchta belgi.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Uy uchun choyshabni yangilashda faqat karavot nomiga qarab tanlash xatosidan saqlaydi. ([casper.com](https://casper.com/blogs/article/bed-sheet-sizes?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10.\n\n5. **Pinduoduo: Yangi parda qayergacha tushadi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Parda ilinadigan joydan istalgan pastki nuqtagacha o‘lchab, mahsulot uzunligi bilan solishtirish. Format: deraza chizmasi.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Uy jihozlarini yangilashda uzunlikni buyurtmadan oldin tekshirish mumkin. ([ikea.com](https://www.ikea.com/nl/en/ideas/measure-the-window-for-curtain-rails-curtain-rods-or-blinds-pubf4dbe0f0/?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10.\n\n6. **Taobao: Yostiq jildi yostiqqa mosmi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Yostiqning eni va bo‘yini o‘lchab, jild tavsifidagi o‘lchamga qarash; bezakli chet bo‘lsa, ichki o‘lchamni aniqlashtirish. Format: ikki o‘lchamli taqqoslash.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Uy uchun mayda xaridda noto‘g‘ri o‘lcham tanlashning oldini oladi. ([casper.com](https://casper.com/blogs/article/pillowcase-size-chart?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10.\n\n7. **Tmall: Buyumni qaytarish xarajatini kim to‘laydi?**  \n   **Burchak:** Masalan, kiyim olishdan oldin sotuvchining qaytarish shartini o‘qish va qaytarish xarajati kimga tushishini aniqlashtirish. Format: uch bandli tekshiruv ro‘yxati.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Chegirmali xaridda ham qaytarish sharti muhim bo‘lishi mumkin. Aniq qoida sotuvchidan tekshiriladi. ([consumer.ftc.gov](https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/online-shopping?sf2589138=1&utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 9/10.\n\n8. **Pinduoduo: Eshik oldi gilamchasi uchun qaysi o‘lcham kerak?**  \n   **Burchak:** Eshik oldidagi joyning eni va bo‘yini o‘lchab, gilamcha o‘lchami bilan solishtirish; qalinligini ham tekshirish. Format: eshik oldi chizmasi.  \n   **Nega hozir:** Kuz-qish mavsumida kirish joyi uchun amaliy mayda xarid. ([ikea.com](https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/sindal-door-mat-natural-80047635/?utm_source=openai))  \n   **Foydalilik:** 8/10.\n\n**Foydalanilgan manbalardan:**\n- REI — *Snow Gloves & Mittens: How to Choose*: https://zippy.rei.com/learn/expert-advice/snow-gloves-and-mittens--how-to-choose.html\n- IKEA — *Bed Sheets*: https://www.ikea.com/us/en/cat/sheets-10681/\n- Tiffany & Co. — *Ring Size Guide*: https://www.tiffany.com/client-services/size-guide.html\n-",
